-1.  **Initialization:** Initialize $J$ control trajectories $\{h_j^0\}_{j=0}^{J-1}$ at $t=0$ using Farthest Point Sampling (FPS) on the initial Gaussian means $\{\mu_i^0\}_{i=0}^{N-1}$ [S1, unofficial].
